{"step_index":8,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-04T11:24:08Z","content":"I'll start drafting the implementation plan while the command runs.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Comprehensive implementation plan for OtakuBazaar — a production-grade Next.js 15 App Router project with Clean Architecture (domain, application, infrastructure, presentation layers), multi-window sync via BroadcastChannel + WebSocket, strict TypeScript, and full JSDoc documentation. Covers ~22 foundational files across all layers, plus Prisma schema, typed error hierarchy, and API route wiring.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# OtakuBazaar — Clean Architecture Foundation\\n\\nA production-grade Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript scaffold for an Amazon/OLX-scale C2C anime marketplace, organized as strict Clean Architecture with real-time multi-window sync.\\n\\n## Proposed Changes\\n\\n### 1. Project Scaffolding\\n\\n#### [NEW] `otaku-bazaar/` — Next.js 15 App Router project\\n\\nBootstrapped via `create-next-app` with:\\n- TypeScript (strict mode, no `any`)\\n- App Router (no Pages Router)\\n- ESLint\\n- `src/` directory enabled\\n- Import alias `@/*` → `src/*`\\n\\nAfter scaffold, the default `src/app` contents will be cleaned and restructured into the Clean Architecture layers below.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. Clean Architecture — Directory Map\\n\\n```\\notaku-bazaar/\\n├── src/\\n│   ├── domain/                         # Layer 0 — Pure business core (ZERO external deps)\\n│   │   ├── entities/\\n│   │   │   ├── Listing.ts              # Listing aggregate root\\n│   │   │   ├── BargainOffer.ts         # Bargain/negotiation entity\\n│   │   │   └── User.ts                 # User entity\\n│   │   ├── value-objects/\\n│   │   │   ├── Money.ts                # Immutable money value object (amount + currency)\\n│   │   │   ├── ListingStatus.ts        # Enum-like discriminated union\\n│   │   │   └── OfferStatus.ts          # Enum-like discriminated union\\n│   │   ├── repositories/\\n│   │   │   ├── IListingRepository.ts   # Port interface for listings persistence\\n│   │   │   └── IBargainOfferRepository.ts\\n│   │   ├── events/\\n│   │   │   └── DomainEvent.ts          # Domain event base + concrete event types\\n│   │   └── types/\\n│   │       └── index.ts                # Centralized shared types (IDs, branded types)\\n│   │\\n│   ├── application/                    # Layer 1 — Use cases & orchestration\\n│   │   ├── use-cases/\\n│   │   │   ├── CreateLis\n<truncated 7700 bytes>","Description":"\"Comprehensive implementation plan for OtakuBazaar Clean Architecture Next.js 15 project\"","Overwrite":"false","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\HP\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity-ide\\\\brain\\\\4ef0148b-ff8c-4889-8f54-3ee5a03210d9\\\\implementation_plan.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating implementation plan\"","toolSummary":"\"Implementation plan artifact\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
