che key.\\n   * @param value - The value to cache (must be JSON-serializable).\\n   * @param ttlSeconds - Time-to-live in seconds. Omit for no expiry.\\n   */\\n  set<T>(key: string, value: T, ttlSeconds?: number): Promise<void>;\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Removes a value from the cache.\\n   *\\n   * @param key - The cache key to delete.\\n   * @returns `true` if the key existed and was removed.\\n   */\\n  delete(key: string): Promise<boolean>;\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Removes all keys matching a pattern.\\n   *\\n   * @param pattern - Glob-style pattern (e.g., 'listing:*').\\n   * @returns The number of keys removed.\\n   */\\n  deletePattern(pattern: string): Promise<number>;\\n}\\n\\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n// In-Memory Cache (Development Stub)\\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\n/** Internal cache entry with optional expiry tracking. */\\ninterface CacheEntry<T> {\\n  readonly value: T;\\n  readonly expiresAt: number | null; // Unix timestamp in ms, null = no expiry\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * In-memory cache implementation for \n<truncated 1348 bytes>","Description":"\"Cache infrastructure with ICache interface + in-memory dev implementation — swappable for Redis in production.\"","Overwrite":"false","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\HP\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity-ide\\\\scratch\\\\otaku-bazaar\\\\src\\\\infrastructure\\\\cache\\\\RedisCache.ts\"","toolAction":"\"Creating cache adapter\"","toolSummary":"\"RedisCache adapter\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
